## 3. Dataset Attribution

The benchmark sequencing metadata (`hands-on/MetadataPublish.xlsx`) originates from:
> Angell, I. L., Nilsen, M., Vandsemb, P., Janssen, E., et al. (2020). *De novo species identification using 16S rRNA gene nanopore sequencing*. **PeerJ**, 8, e10029. https://doi.org/10.7717/peerj.10029

The original dataset is licensed under **Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)**.

